		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je traille sur une sorte de mini ERP. J&#039;ai besoin de modéliser une structure d&#039;un arbre à nombre de niveau indéni<br />A_____<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__B<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__C<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__D<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__E__<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__F<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__G<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__H<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__I__<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__ J<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__K__<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |__L&#160; &#160;|_M<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |_N<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |_O<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;<br />Quelle est la structure des tables à adopter?<br />Comment à partir d&#039;un élément ajouter un fils au niveau inférieur?<br />Comment à partir d&#039;un élément connaitre le niveau supérieur?<br />Comment à partir d&#039;un élément connaitre le niveau inférieur? tous les niveaux inférieurs?<br />Merci</p>]]></content>
